title: "GH-1511: keep blocked work prioritization inside context cursor page boundaries"
description: "Published-release report: walking a producer cursor over two items repeats blocked active work and omits the next row. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1511 . Distinct from the completed producer/output-budget composition defect."
