author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: Reproduce the two-item producer-only cursor walk with active blocked and next actionable rows; assert unique complete IDs and final counters; retain output-budget continuation semantics.
parent: pm-4k6b
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: Pack active blocked rows only when selected by the current producer page. Retain lifecycle-blocked companion detail and truthful final delivered-row counters.
expected_result: An unchanged two-item cursor walk returns each selected focus ID once; multiple active blocked rows preserve per-page blocked counters.
actual_result: "The original two-row reproducer and the expanded two-blocked/one-actionable fixture pass SDK CLI and MCP. One-row and two-row page walks retain unique complete membership and exact blocked counts. Existing packed Node/Bun producer and budget continuation acceptance passes. PR1515 code head7ba76fd6ce2d43937e0c490343e8c9e195d7a82c: CI39376468501 passed all required hosted checks; exact coverage lines66214/66214 statements69818/69818 functions14387/14387 branches53652/53652. DeepScan0new and CodeFactor0annotations. Final review test improvement passes the focused linked transport suite. Original failed local performance and mutation-timeout receipts remain failed."
