  "2026-10-20T05:13:03.835Z","harness:codex","Live operational proof before review: strict complete intake3020items including2740closed and zero unreadable/omitted rows; only four implementation leaves are in progress. validate resolution/history returns ok with zero drift plus170 historical closure-metadata warnings; health returns ok with eight existing legacy hierarchy warnings. Latest pm-changelog2026.10.19-1 check and deep package doctor pass. Dependency audit and secret scan report zero findings. Required Sentry/telemetry gate passes at2.36percent error rate with zero missing-code rows; fresh opt-in get/context/deps spans arrived at05:06:59 through05:07:08UTC. The closed telemetry window has one matching start/finish pair per read and no command_error; explicit flush empties logical and physical queue, broker queue0, six Prometheus targets up. Broad Release Reliability and deferred dependency migrations remain separate open work. No all-green historical claim."
  "2026-10-20T05:25:21.171Z","harness:codex","Complete local coverage attempt ended with exactly one assertion failure: existing tests/unit/sdk/governance-read-performance.spec.ts measured health10177.906399ms against its unchanged10000ms ceiling. The full new context transport regression file passed. Vitest withheld coverage-summary.json after the failing run, and the exact coverage gate consequently failed; neither full-suite success nor100percent coverage is claimed. Preserve this immutable failed linked receipt. Isolated reproduction, complete static gates and final hosted exact-head coverage remain required; no timeout or performance assertion is relaxed."
  "2026-10-20T05:33:19.953Z","harness:codex","The complete local run has10823 passed cases, one governance-read performance failure and three explicit skips across834files; elapsed1147seconds. All four new regressions and the real Node/Bun composed continuation case pass. The four-way published writer/reader compatibility matrix also passes for2026.10.18 and2026.10.19, including SDK exact unknown fields restore native merge and history. Fresh installed npm and Bun2026.10.20 agent sessions pass13steps each. A focused instrumented diagnostic is queued after static validation to recheck the existing performance assertion without concurrent local acceptance work and expose changed-module coverage; its partial global denominator will remain a diagnostic, not a full-suite pass."
  "2026-10-20T05:44:38.596Z","harness:codex","Implementation pushed as7ba76fd6c in https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1515 . Only the four implementation leaves remain active during hosted acceptance and review. Final typecheck passes; bounded mutation passes345/352 with seven unchanged equivalents and a raised98.01136363636364floor. The final focused linked integration run passes all four new regressions. The dependency-command diagnostic passes45tests with100percent lines statements branches and functions for src/sdk/dependencies.ts, while deliberately partial global coverage remains failed rather than relabeled. The original full local governance timing failure remains immutable; that unchanged test passes in the124-case instrumented diagnostic. Requested all configured reviewers once on this head and started the blocking exact-head check watcher. Closure and package-owned changelog generation remain part of this same PR after hosted acceptance."
  "2026-10-20T05:58:45.466Z","harness:codex","The corrected full static pipeline again passed every prefix through both unchanged performance ratchets, graph composition and record integrity, then failed its terminal mutation phase on ten timeouts. Its seven equivalent survivors and total352mutants are unchanged; a previous exact-source isolated mutation run already passed345killed/7equivalent with zero timeouts. This second full-pipeline failure is retained as failed; it is not relabeled successful. Run the identical isolated mutation phase once more without changing tests source concurrency deadlines policy or score floor, while exact-head hosted checks continue."
